-- @record {"chapter":"goal-cascade","data":"Use request-owner-handoff on a freshly observed CAPTCHA or bot check; use request-checked-owner-handoff to retain explicit completion predicates. The same tab, profile and runtime stay in use; no solver or engine switch is introduced. The right pane remains interactive for the owner. Resume task is owner-only and re-observes the page; an uncleared wall remains needs_owner, and a second resume refuses. A queued pane is not rendered proof.","key":"5","section":"guidance"}
M browser "Use request-owner-handoff on a freshly observed CAPTCHA or bot check; use request-checked-owner-handoff to retain explicit completion predicates. The same tab, profile and runtime stay in use; no solver or engine switch is introduced. The right pane remains interactive for the owner. Resume task is owner-only and re-observes the page; an uncleared wall remains needs_owner, and a second resume refuses. A queued pane is not rendered proof." src:"authored manual" state:verified
