L browser.ui v1 -- Search browser chrome and agent presence
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"Chrome is Search's: the left tab column shows spaces as initials at the top, pinned tabs as icons, New tab, then one shared list of user and agent tabs. An agent tab has a coin with its provider mark; the coin is warm while the agent works and a gold dot means it is waiting. Downloads and More sit in the footer. The fold key hides the tab column.","key":"0","section":"guidance"}
M browser "Chrome is Search's: the left tab column shows spaces as initials at the top, pinned tabs as icons, New tab, then one shared list of user and agent tabs. An agent tab has a coin with its provider mark; the coin is warm while the agent works and a gold dot means it is waiting. Downloads and More sit in the footer. The fold key hides the tab column." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"One quiet top line holds Back, Forward and Reload, the single address/search field with history completion, then Reader, Split and the privacy shield at the right. The browser chrome belongs to the pane; there is no extra Browser title bar, Home title or separate Agent tabs section.","key":"1","section":"guidance"}
M browser "One quiet top line holds Back, Forward and Reload, the single address/search field with history completion, then Reader, Split and the privacy shield at the right. The browser chrome belongs to the pane; there is no extra Browser title bar, Home title or separate Agent tabs section." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"More and Ctrl K expose Give an agent a task in the browser, Start the agent engine or Stop the agent engine, and What the agent sees. These replace the separate Give an agent a task button and engine On/Off row. Ctrl K also lists tabs.","key":"2","section":"guidance"}
