-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"An agent tab shows the live Obscura frame edge to edge at the actual pane size, without a surrounding box or banner. Re-measure the viewport on resize and retain the last frame between updates. While the agent acts, a thin warm page edge and a soft label on the touched element show its presence, for example Typing in Quantity or Clicking Add to basket.","key":"3","section":"guidance"}
M browser "An agent tab shows the live Obscura frame edge to edge at the actual pane size, without a surrounding box or banner. Re-measure the viewport on resize and retain the last frame between updates. While the agent acts, a thin warm page edge and a soft label on the touched element show its presence, for example Typing in Quantity or Clicking Add to basket." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"The address field contains an agent presence pill: <Agent> is browsing offers Watch on desktop and Take over; <Agent> wants to act on this page offers Allow and Not now; <Agent> is paused offers Let it act. Waiting is an inline request, not a full-width banner.","key":"4","section":"guidance"}
M browser "The address field contains an agent presence pill: <Agent> is browsing offers Watch on desktop and Take over; <Agent> wants to act on this page offers Allow and Not now; <Agent> is paused offers Let it act. Waiting is an inline request, not a full-width banner." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"The eye icon in the pill opens What the agent sees, a drawer closed by default. On the page shows fields, headings, buttons and links; As text shows the perception view. This machine view stays in the drawer rather than replacing the page.","key":"5","section":"guidance"}
M browser "The eye icon in the pill opens What the agent sees, a drawer closed by default. On the page shows fields, headings, buttons and links; As text shows the perception view. This machine view stays in the drawer rather than replacing the page." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"Allow keeps the existing tab.grant enabled:true effect. Take over uses promote with the agent stopped on desktop; in the web build it uses tab.grant enabled:false. Watch uses promote while keeping the agent. These labels do not change control authority or the existing procedure effects.","key":"6","section":"guidance"}
M browser "Allow keeps the existing tab.grant enabled:true effect. Take over uses promote with the agent stopped on desktop; in the web build it uses tab.grant enabled:false. Watch uses promote while keeping the agent. These labels do not change control authority or the existing procedure effects." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"In the web build, the owner viewport operation takes {tabId,width,height,scale} and follows the pane dimensions. User-owned tabs are shown read-only through a hidden Obscura mirror opened with tab.open mirrorOf. The pill says Read-only preview. Open it in the desktop app to use this page yourself. Show the live preview rather than an empty dark box. tab.open also accepts openedBy for the agent provider mark.","key":"7","section":"guidance"}
M browser "In the web build, the owner viewport operation takes {tabId,width,height,scale} and follows the pane dimensions. User-owned tabs are shown read-only through a hidden Obscura mirror opened with tab.open mirrorOf. The pill says Read-only preview. Open it in the desktop app to use this page yourself. Show the live preview rather than an empty dark box. tab.open also accepts openedBy for the agent provider mark." src:"authored manual" state:verified
-- @record {"chapter":"ui","data":"With no tab open there is no start page: focus the address field and list recent history directly below it. Page content fills the pane without a rounded card. Browser colours use the existing theme tokens, and the tab column follows the Neyvia sidebar styling.","key":"8","section":"guidance"}
M browser "With no tab open there is no start page: focus the address field and list recent history directly below it. Page content fills the pane without a rounded card. Browser colours use the existing theme tokens, and the tab column follows the Neyvia sidebar styling." src:"authored manual" state:verified
